  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Syria Joint Response 2024-2026 - lead agency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Syria Joint Response is part of the Protracted Crisis Mechanism of the Dutch Relief Alliance and is a consortium consisting of Dorcas, Oxfam, Terre des Hommes and ZOA, providing life saving assistance to Government Held Areas in Syria. Targeted sectors are WASH, Education, Health, Livelihoods support and Protection.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activities are implemented in the governorates Hama, Aleppo and Rural Damascus. It is anticipated that the Syria Joint Response will reach around 460.000 beneficiaries.</narrative>
  </description>
